    "intro_narrative": "The neon-drenched depths of Sector 7 hold many secrets, but none as valuable as the lost corporate ledger of OmniCorp. As a rogue netrunner, you've infiltrated their abandoned subterranean data vault. The air is thick with the hum of decaying servers and the faint, erratic glow of holographic interfaces. Your objective is clear: breach the central mainframe and extract the secure datacache before the automated security systems reboot and lock you inside forever. To succeed, you must navigate a tangled web of obsolete cyber-tools, routing data streams through various archaic decryption modules to finally crack the system. Time is running out, and the ice is getting thicker.",
    "narrative_style": "cyberpunk"
  },
